  "label": "Enslaved people being forced to work under supervision",
  "description": "A scene depicting enslaved individuals being physically restrained and coerced into labor under the watch of a white overseer. The spatial arrangement shows the enslaved people in a line, bound and struggling, while the overseer stands at the rear, directing them. The scene conveys a hierarchy of power and control, with the overseer positioned to dominate and the enslaved people positioned as subjugated laborers.",
